003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「见习天使」直播开启：2026-03-06 19:30:00（UTC+8）\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「特别出席」直播开启：2026-03-14 19:30:00（UTC+8）\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【参与条件】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e绳网等级≥20级，完成主线第一章·幕间后即可在游戏内「活动」功能中解锁「絮羽直播间」活动界面。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【奖励说明】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 在游戏内「絮羽直播间」活动界面中，绳匠点击「更多精彩」按钮，即可获得[菲林]*30；待直播内容上线后，绳匠选择对应直播、点击「观看直播」按钮，观看两场直播或对应的直播回放，均可分别获得[菲林]*30；参与活动，共可获得[菲林]*90。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/162563/7f222ee9d50fc570ef7a5a47329563cd_3553625573962190198.png\" href=\"\" data-origin-width=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"CHS.png\",\"url\":\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/162563/b426cfdce5b52eb791fc43fd06f3af23_7971306447888762898.png\"}],\"news-self-path\":\"\"}","dtStartTime":"2026-02-06 11:15:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","dtCreateTime":"2026-02-05 10:28:14","iInfoId":162563,"sTagName":[],"sCategoryName":"","sSign":""},"prevContent":{"sChanId":["295"],"sTitle":"「妄想协鸣于此刻」活动介绍","sIntro":"「新艾利都启愿星」已开赛！与「妄想天使」共同见证…","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「新艾利都启愿星」已开赛！与「妄想天使」共同见证…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-hei